# Trivy suppressions for the CI vuln gate (.forgejo/workflows/*.yml).
#
# The `trivy` jobs fail on fixable HIGH/CRITICAL findings. To accept a specific
# advisory (e.g. a false positive or an unavoidable transitive), add its ID on
# its own line, ideally with a short justification + review date. Keep this file
# small and reviewed — every entry weakens the gate.
#
# Format: one vulnerability ID per line, e.g.
#   CVE-2024-12345   # transitive via <pkg>; no fix upstream yet — review 2026-12
#
# (no suppressions yet)
